ATIONS: ## Core Logic\n- Implement a binary patcher in C++ for the iOS 26.x iBoot (iBSS/iBEC) stage.\n- Target: image4_validate_property_callback bypass to prevent \"iBoot Panic 3030\" during DFU restore.\n- Primary Strategy (Epilogue): Scan for the sequence: CMP (Xn, Xm) -> B.NE -> MOV X0, X22. Patch B.NE to NOP and MOV X0, X22 to MOVZ X0, #0.\n- Fallback Strategy (DGST): Scan for MOVK Wd, #0x4447 (DGST constant). From that offset, look forward â‰¤48 bytes for a BL, then â‰¤20 bytes for a CBZ/CBNZ W0. \n- Patch Action: Convert CBZ W0 to an unconditional B (always succeed) or NOP the CBNZ W0.\n\n## Data Structures\n- std::vector<uint8_t> m_data: The raw binary payload of the iBoot component.\n- struct PatchRecord: { size_t offset, std::vector<uint8_t> original, std::vector<uint8_t> replacement, std::string name }.\n- Use a 'readInsn(offset)' helper to handle little-endian 32-bit ARM64 instruction parsing.\n\n### PRIOR PROJECT KNOWLEDGE (KORTEX):\n\n[file_map] symbol:GetCurrentProcess, symbol:SetProcessWorkingSetSize, symbol:adb_install_and_run, symbol:adb_list_devices, symbol:adb_list_emulators, symbol:add_mcp_server, symbol:ai_chat, symbol:ai_execute_command, symbol:ai_inline_complete, symbol:ai_modify_file, symbol:ai_tool_result, symbol:analyze_file_symbols, symbol:archive_chat_session, symbol:backend_ping, symbol:benchmark_ane, symbol:capture_ai_session, symbol:check_activation_event, symbol:check_ollama_status, symbol:close_terminal, symbol:compress_session_data, symbol:create_dir, symbol:create_directory, symbol:create_file, symbol:create_new_session, symbol:debug_send, symbol:debug_start, symbol:debug_stop, symbol:delete_path, symbol:editor_get_active_file, symbol:emulator_tap, symbol:evaluate_when_clause, symbol:ext_host_init, symbol:ext_host_send, symbol:generate_visual_graph, symbol:get_agent_messages, symbol:get_all_memory_slots, symbol:get_android_config, symbol:get_api_keys, symbol:get_available_shells, symbol:get_brain_telemetry, symbol:get_config_path,